                {
                    "text": "Kaamaalai kannukku, kandathellaam manjalaaga thaan therium. \ud83e\udd29  Ethu varai ready aana list ai aruvippaaga 7th March andru solli vittaar.  Aduththa List ready aaginu erukku.  Adutha arivippil therivikkiren yendru  sonnaarey!, athai gavanikkavillaiyaa?  60 + yellaam spl. Paa. Athu aduththa List la arivvippu varum varai kaaththirungal, eppadi avasara pattaal yeppadi? Next,   Handicraft, 60 +  etc., arivvippu varum.  Athuvarai porumai avasiyam.  Evvalavu, sinthiththu, arivvippu ready pannavarukku,  avargalai vittuviduvaaraa yenna?  Yellorukkaagavum, avar erukkiraar.  But, neenga thaan avarai santhega kannotathileye paarththu kondu erukkireergal.",
